        <mxCell id="description" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Inside one environment&amp;#x27;s resource group: guests&amp;#x27; requests pass the WAF and Front Door and reach the Static Web App with the Front Door ID header. The Static Web App sends every visitor to Entra ID to sign in, except for the health page. Application Insights tests the health page from five regions. Front Door logs and test results feed Log Analytics, which drives the alerts and the workbook dashboard." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5c5c5c;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="62" width="960.0" height="60" as="geometry" />
